#: ../../source/extglob_README.md:280
msgid ""
"This library has complete parity with Bash 4.3 with only a couple of "
"minor differences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/extglob_README.md:282
msgid ""
"In some cases Bash returns true if the given string \"contains\" the "
"pattern, whereas this library returns true if the string is an exact "
"match for the pattern. You can relax this by setting `options.contains` "
"to true."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/extglob_README.md:283
msgid ""
"This library is more accurate than Bash and thus does not fail some of "
"the tests that Bash 4.3 still lists as failing in their unit tests"
msgstr ""

